        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Every texture key (``tex_&lt;object&gt;_&lt;role&gt;``) ``HashData`` files &apos;hash&apos; under for the
character &apos;name&apos;, at any version :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

More than one when the character draws several objects with one texture -- Yelan&apos;s body
and dress share ``df127976`` -- and an override of that texture recolours all of them
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>name</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The character&apos;s mod type name, eg. <computeroutput>Yelan</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>hash</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The texture hash</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The keys, each once, in the table&apos;s order </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
